It contains a signed, cross-language conformance battery (rfc9421_negative_v1)
for RFC 9421 HTTP Message Signatures, exercised by four independent verifier
implementations (Python, TypeScript, Rust, Go). The signing and provenance
backbone is provided by algovoi-corpus-cm (JCS RFC 8785 canonicalisation, EdDSA
compact JWS, hash-chained provenance).
